our brain is still going to perceive your home as a mess. If you've got stuff all over the floor, stuff all over the surfaces, there's no amount of polishing, shining, cleaning is going to make that go away or look better. It is the clutter, it is tidying that you need to do first.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Problem"}, {"shortCode": "DbTDt6LtKhC", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbTDt6LtKhC/", "caption": "All of brains and our homes are unique, the trick is finding a way that works for you \ud83e\ude77\ud83e\ude77", "timestamp": "2026-07-27T13:21:46.000Z", "videoDuration": 57.142, "videoPlayCount": 12773, "videoViewCount": 2021, "likesCount": -1, "commentsCount": 5, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/758469011_18449756413142472_3261662698980646722_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gHGpk4eDhQRBGxqWTBHXAcx4SViQjE54Weprqi8gAVILCCagOxCilEG9Ify9x58IhI&_nc_ohc=msfUBlmkIHQQ7kNvwFryug_&_nc_gid=0sr1Tcpavnmsfwjh9_uinw&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQH10TPnYK9csspVrP0mVqF8ewe0FWM6B68w2MDFdRmH0w&oe=6A876DE8&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMvBFg_uYhJc9x0bn7iKbMyIDZCkqJmj3echSKtEVvvLo_ZrDwts-RuiVeoGuWGpz4ctdmVsBijKG3cY23FRnLiSsdVur7jOAzg9ZU.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-icn2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=PHmGBxwHy84Q7kNvwEMP4z2&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc3MzQyNDUxMDMzMzczNywiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE5LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6NTcsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=79915062fd226c9d&_nc_&_nc_gid=0sr1Tcpavnmsfwjh9_uinw&_nc_ss=7a22e&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQElJf8QXvLbn86fF4w4h6Fu7i0uE9mhx9MqxzCE1ozlnA&oe=6A837B62", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "the_organised_mum", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "au